flow you want to integrate.\n31:     The [cURL quickstart](/transform/first-request) provides a standalone example.\n32:   </Step>\n33: \n34:   <Step title=\"Configure and run the request\">\n35:     Set your [API key variable](/transform/authentication) and replace the sample file path, then run the request. Keep the key outside shared code and repositories.\n36:     Inspect the result. For HTTP 202, retain the complete `Location` URL and follow [request progress](/transform/jobs).\n37:   </Step>\n38: </Steps>\n39: \n40: ## Extend your integration\n41: \n42: Use the [API reference](/transform/api-reference) for request options and [recovery guidance](/transform/recovery) for errors.\n43: \n44: \n45: \nThe above content shows the entire, complete file contents of the requested file.\n"}
